{"ID":"20240506102355-hebzjzs","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240506102355-hebzjzs","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240506102355-hebzjzs\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240628103026-pl9gysq\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240612184231-nw5xyfk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240628104549-g4dld8u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"273莨菪子（莨荡子、天仙子）","type":"doc","updated":"20240823172206"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240711173659-0te0ii5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711173659-0te0ii5","updated":"20240711173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产河南、河北、辽宁等地。\n【性状】\t呈类扁肾形或扁卵形，直径约1mm。表面棕黄色或灰黄色，有细密的网纹，略尖的一端有点状种脐。剖面灰白色，油质，有胚乳，胚弯曲。无臭，味微辛。\n【性味】\t苦、辛，温；有大毒。\n【功效】\t解痉止痛，安神定喘。用于胃痉挛疼痛，喘咳，癫狂。"}]},{"ID":"20240711173659-x7208to","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240711173659-x7208to","updated":"20240711173659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206103221-f4l8s6n.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240628103026-pl9gysq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628103026-pl9gysq","updated":"20240628103026"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 344px;","style":"width: 334px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240628103026-fg5c0wx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 334px;\" parent-style=\"width: 344px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240628103307-ps1qyfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628103307-ps1qyfy","updated":"20240823172206"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 346px;","style":"width: 336px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240628103846-40iqvum.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 336px;\" parent-style=\"width: 346px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 746px;","style":"width: 736px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪 2-20240822164045-so8425d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 736px;\" parent-style=\"width: 746px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240628103349-5m681mi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628103349-5m681mi","updated":"20240822164055"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 479px;","style":"width: 469px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪子2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪子2-20240628103157-xue8nc5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 469px;\" parent-style=\"width: 479px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 760px;","style":"width: 750px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪子3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪子3-20240628103227-lxh9fnc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 750px;\" parent-style=\"width: 760px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240628104358-9n9d4m4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628104358-9n9d4m4","updated":"20240822164057"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 659px;","style":"width: 649px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪子6"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪子6-20240628104443-0ji4o1d.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 649px;\" parent-style=\"width: 659px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 583px;","style":"width: 573px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪子5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪子5-20240628104345-vkkkeaj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 573px;\" parent-style=\"width: 583px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822164127-hfj9j6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822164127-hfj9j6r","updated":"20240822164259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 772px;","style":"width: 762px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪 3-20240822164127-0ogpij5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 762px;\" parent-style=\"width: 772px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 441px;","style":"width: 431px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪 4-20240822164259-ftuesqa.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 431px;\" parent-style=\"width: 441px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822164401-khyfdg8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822164401-khyfdg8","updated":"20240822164411"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 284px;","style":"width: 274px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪 5-20240822164401-5qrnp7k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 274px;\" parent-style=\"width: 284px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 285px;","style":"width: 275px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天仙子"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天仙子-20240628104012-kho1o4n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 275px;\" parent-style=\"width: 285px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 663px;","style":"width: 653px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"莨菪 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/莨菪 1-20240822163927-61iu796.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 653px;\" parent-style=\"width: 663px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240822163256-e4kkf1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240822163256-e4kkf1g","updated":"20240822164418"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 734px;","style":"width: 724px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"天仙子3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/天仙子3-20240628104203-i73k818.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 724px;\" parent-style=\"width: 734px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240628104529-gzet2fu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240628104529-gzet2fu"}},{"ID":"20240628104549-g4dld8u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240628104549-g4dld8u","updated":"20240628104553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨荡子《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240628104549-8x19c58","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628104549-8x19c58","updated":"20240628104549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240628104549-gc4dxl1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628104549-gc4dxl1","updated":"20240628104549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主齿痛出虫，肉痹，拘急，使人健行，见鬼，多食令人狂走。久服轻身，走及奔马，强志益力通神。一名横唐。生川谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240628104549-htjup24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628104549-htjup24","updated":"20240628104549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：一名行唐，生海滨，及壅州，五月采子。"}]},{"ID":"20240628104549-ld9de8v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240628104549-ld9de8v","updated":"20240628104549"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《广雅》云：（上艹下恐）萍，（上艹下阆）（上艹下砀）也。陶宏景云：今方家多作狼蓎，旧作菪。案《说文》无菪蓎字。《史记》淳于意《传》云：灾川王美人怀子而不乳，引以莨荡药一撮，本草图经引，作浪荡，是。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184454-5as7vnl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184454-5as7vnl"}},{"ID":"20240612184454-8ej27la","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184454-8ej27la","updated":"20240612184504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184454-roa50lm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184454-roa50lm","updated":"20240612184459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子，生海滨川谷及雍州，今处处有之。苗茎高二、三尺许，叶似地黄、王不留行、红蓝等而三指阔；四月开花，紫色；苗、荚、茎有白毛；五月结实，有壳作罂子，状如小石榴，房中子至细，青白色，如米粒，一名天仙子。五月采子，阴干。谨按《本经》云∶莨菪性寒，后人多云大热，而《史记》淳于意传云∶淄川王美人怀子而不乳，意饮以浪荡药一撮，以酒饮之，旋乳。且不乳岂热药所治。又古方主卒癫狂，亦多单用莨菪，不知果性寒邪？《小品》载治癫狂方云∶取莨菪三升，作末，酒一升，渍数日出，捣之，以向汁和绞，去滓，汤上煎，令可丸，服如小豆三丸，日三。当觉口面急，头中有虫行，额及手足有赤色处，如此并是瘥候。未知再服，取尽，神良。又《箧中方》主肠风，莨菪煎。取莨菪实一升治之，曝干，捣筛，生姜半斤，取汁，二物相合银锅中，更以无灰酒二升，投之，上火煎令如稠饧，即旋投酒，度用酒可及五升以来，即止煎，令可丸，大如梧子。每旦酒饮通下三丸，增至五、七丸止。若丸时粘手，则菟丝粉衬隔煎熬，切戒火紧，则药易焦而失力矣。初服微热，勿怪。疾甚者，服过三日，当下利，疾去，利亦止，绝有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184127-je81kg4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184127-je81kg4"}},{"ID":"20240612184440-bntn4zw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184440-bntn4zw","updated":"20240612184445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184440-whlcefd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184440-whlcefd","updated":"20240612184440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一名天仙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612184440-f130tzy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184440-f130tzy","updated":"20240612184440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"子苦寒，根苦辛，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184440-vxn6ct3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184440-vxn6ct3","updated":"20240612184440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主齿痛，出虫，肉痹拘急，多食令人狂走。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184440-070obju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184440-070obju","updated":"20240612184440"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪入癫狂方用，然皆用其子耳。故言勿令子破，破则令人发狂。《本经》治肉痹虫 ，用其毒以攻治也。《千金》治石痈坚硬不作脓者，莨菪子为末，醋和敷疮头，根即拔出。打扑折伤，羊脂调莨菪子末敷之。莨菪根主治与子不殊，疟疾不止，莨菪根烧灰水服一钱七即止。恶癣有虫，莨菪根捣烂和蜜敷之。恶刺伤人，莨菪根水煮汁浸，冷即易之，箭头不出，此亦主之，皆《千金》神方也。狂犬咬人，莨菪根和盐，日三敷之，此《外台秘要》方也。今人用根治噎膈反胃，取其性走以祛胃中留滞之邪，噎膈得以暂开。虚者误服为害不测。时珍云∶莨菪之功，未见如所说，而其毒有甚焉，煮一二日尚能生芽，其为物可知矣。服莨菪、云实、防葵、赤商陆，皆令人狂惑见鬼者，盖此类皆禀阴毒，能使痰迷心窍，闭其神明，以乱视听故耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184127-om0mtfp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184127-om0mtfp"}},{"ID":"20240612184430-66zzeh3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-66zzeh3","updated":"20240612184434"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-8lj9tdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-8lj9tdb","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」天仙子、横唐、行唐。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-ioibgz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-ioibgz0","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（子）苦、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-whzcq08","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-whzcq08","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-r8jgt2o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-r8jgt2o","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、突发颠狂。用莨菪三升，研细，在一升酒中泡几天。去渣，煎成浓汁。一天内分三次饮完。如觉头中似有虫行，额部及手脚现红点，即是病快要好的现象。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-4vm0dm7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-4vm0dm7","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、风痹厥痛。和莨菪三钱（炒），大草乌头、甘草各半两，五灵脂一两，共研为末。加糊做成丸子，如梧子大，以螺青为衣。每服十丸，男子用菖蒲酒送下，女子用芫花汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-712l7ox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-712l7ox","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、久咳不止（痰有脓血）。用莨菪子五钱，先煮后炒，研细，加酥油如鸡收蛎的量，大枣七枚，同煎至油尽。取枣日食三枚。又方：取莨菪子三撮吞服，一天服五、六次，极验。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-3kyj5c6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-3kyj5c6","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、长期水泻。用干枣十个，去核，填入莨菪子，扎定，烧存性。每服一钱，粟米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-pbrtwfu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-pbrtwfu","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、赤白痢。用大黄（煨）半两、莨菪子（炒黑）一撮，共研为末。每服一钱，米汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-m2xwzbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-m2xwzbc","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、肠风下血。用莨菪子一升，晒干、捣烂、筛细；生姜半斤，取汁；同入银锅中加二升。一起煎成浓糖稀状，再倒入酒五升，慢火上进一步煎浓，做成丸子，如梧子大。每天早晨用酒送服三丸，视病情可增至五、七丸。安服有微热。勿惊异，病重的人服过三日，当有下泻病愈后，泻亦止。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-fc3akt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-fc3akt5","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、脱肛不收。用莨菪子炒过，研为末，敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-mc5m7f4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-mc5m7f4","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、风牙虫牙。用莨菪子一撮，放在小口瓶内烧类。以小管引烟入病齿处。又方：把莨菪子装入瓶内，热汤淋药得气，吸入口中，药冷即换。有涎出，可吐去。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-m5rcrlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-m5rcrlz","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、风毒咽肿或瘰疬咽肿，吞水不下。用莨菪子研为末，每服两小匙，水送下。极效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-zwrlucj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-zwrlucj","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、乳痈坚硬。用新莨菪子半匙，清水一碗磅服。注意不得把药嚼破。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-m61urqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-m61urqa","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11、恶疮似癞，长期不愈。用莨菪子烧存性，研为末，敷患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184430-loi191z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184430-loi191z","updated":"20240612184430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"12、跌打损伤。用莨菪子三工业区末，加羊油调涂伤处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184127-efh5dkm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184127-efh5dkm"}},{"ID":"20240612184421-mjryl1y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184421-mjryl1y","updated":"20240612184424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184421-wlo7e6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184421-wlo7e6r","updated":"20240612184421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦甘，寒，有毒。主齿痛出虫，肉痹拘急，使人健行，见鬼。疗癫狂风痫，颠倒拘挛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184421-skhqspn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184421-skhqspn","updated":"20240612184421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多食令人狂走。久服轻身，走及奔马，强志，益力，通神。一名横唐，一名行唐。生海滨川谷及雍州，五月采子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184127-glcebih","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184127-glcebih"}},{"ID":"20240612184410-a9ibjul","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184410-a9ibjul","updated":"20240612184415"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184410-luk0l3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184410-luk0l3o","updated":"20240612184410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，寒，有毒。主齿痛出虫，肉痹拘急，使人健行见鬼。疗癫狂风痫，颠倒拘挛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184410-7x53fh6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184410-7x53fh6","updated":"20240612184410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多走及奔马，强志，益力，通神。一名横唐，一名行唐。生海滨川谷及雍州。五月采子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184410-t2d6123","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184410-t2d6123","updated":"20240612184410"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今处处亦有。子形颇似五味核而极小。惟入疗癫狂方用，寻此乃不可多食过剂耳。久服自无嫌，通神健行，足为大益，而《仙经》不见用之，今方家多作莨 也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184128-lg8of8s","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184128-lg8of8s"}},{"ID":"20240612184354-0n0pfja","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184354-0n0pfja","updated":"20240612184402"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184354-akqk3rb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184354-akqk3rb","updated":"20240612184354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子苦甘寒有毒，专能截风治痫搐，杀虫齿痛定癫狂，多服放荡无拘束。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184354-qvk39pg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184354-qvk39pg","updated":"20240612184354"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即天仙子，多服久以善走。先用醋煮，次牛乳浸黑者真。晒干，生用泻火。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184128-38cthif","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184128-38cthif"}},{"ID":"20240612184129-ztksjkk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184129-ztksjkk","updated":"20240612184142"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184129-wmoyvsh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184129-wmoyvsh","updated":"20240612184129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、甘，寒，有毒。主齿痛出虫，肉痹拘急，使人健行，见鬼，疗癫狂风痫，颠倒拘挛。多食令人狂走。久服轻身，走及奔马，强志益力，通神。一名横唐，一名行唐。生海滨川谷及雍州。五月采子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184129-3vm25yw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184129-3vm25yw","updated":"20240612184129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今处处有。子形颇似五味核而极小。唯入疗癫狂方用，寻此乃不可多食过剂尔。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184129-rsgmfgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184129-rsgmfgs","updated":"20240612184129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"久服自无嫌，通神健行，足为大益，而《仙经》不见用。今方家多作野狼 。今按陈藏器本草云∶莨菪子，主 癖，安心定志，聪明耳目，除邪逐风，变白，性温不寒，取子洗曝干。隔日空腹水下一指捻勿令子破，破即令人发狂。亦用小便浸之令泣，小便尽曝干，根据前服之。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶叶似王不留行、菘蓝等。茎、叶有细毛，花白，子壳作罂子形，实扁细，若粟米许，青黄色。所在皆有。六月、七月采子，日干。药性论云∶莨菪亦可单用，味苦、辛，微热，有大毒。生能泻人见鬼，拾针狂乱。热炒止冷痢，主齿痛， 牙孔，子，咬之虫出。锻石清煮一伏时，掬出，去芽曝干。以附子、干姜、陈橘皮、桂心、浓朴为丸。去一切冷气，积年气痢，甚温暖。热发用录豆汁解之，焦炒碾细末，治下部脱肛。日华子云∶温，有毒。甘草、升麻、犀角并能解之。烧熏 牙及洗阴汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184129-fmrqhm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184129-fmrqhm4","updated":"20240612184129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶莨菪子，生海滨川谷及雍州，今处处有之。苗茎高二、三尺。叶似地黄、王不留行、红蓝等，而三指阔。四月开花，紫色。苗、荚、茎有白毛。五月结实，有壳作罂子状，如小石榴。房中子至细，青白色，如米粒。一名天仙子。五月采子，阴干。谨按《本经》云∶莨菪性寒，后人多云大热。而《史记·淳于意传》云∶淄川王美人怀子而不乳，意饮以浪荡药一撮，以酒饮之，旋乳。且不乳岂热药所治？又古方主卒癫狂亦多单用莨菪，不知果性寒邪？《短剧》载治癫狂方云∶取莨菪三升作末，酒一升渍数日，出捣之，以向汁和绞去滓，汤上煎令可丸服，如小豆三丸，日三。当觉口面急，头中有虫行，额及手足有赤色处，如此并是瘥候。未知再服，取尽神良。又《箧中方》∶主肠风。莨菪煎∶取莨菪实一升，治之。曝干捣筛，生姜半斤取汁，二物相合，银锅中更以无灰酒二升投之，上火煎令如稠饧，即旋投酒，度用酒可及五升以来，即止煎。令可丸大如梧子。每旦酒饮通下三丸，增至五、七丸止。若丸时粘手，则菟丝粉衬隔。煎熬切戒火紧，则药易焦而失力矣。初服微热，勿怪。疾甚者，服过三日，当下利。疾去，利亦止。绝有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184129-2m0av8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184129-2m0av8r","updated":"20240612184129"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，勿令使苍冥子。其形相似，只是服无效，时人多用杂之。其苍冥子，色微赤若修事十两，以头醋一镒，煮尽醋为度。却用黄牛乳汁浸一宿，至明看牛乳汁黑，即是莨菪子，大毒。晒干别捣重筛用。勿误服，冲人心大烦闷，眼生暹火。别说云谨按莨菪之功，未见如所说，而其毒有甚煮一、二日而芽方生，用者宜审之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184130-14zmq5u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184130-14zmq5u"}},{"ID":"20240612184154-8x9zdkj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184154-8x9zdkj","updated":"20240612184159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184154-b9vwpst","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184154-b9vwpst","updated":"20240612184154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒，有毒。主治齿痛出虫，肉痹拘急。久服轻身，使人健行，走及奔马，强志益力，通神见鬼，多食令人狂走。（莨，莨浪。菪，音荡。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184154-iua68k6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184154-iua68k6","updated":"20240612184154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子一名天仙子。《别录》曰∶生海滨川谷及雍州，今所在皆有之。叶似菘蓝，茎叶皆有细白毛，四月开花紫色，或白色，五月结实有壳，作罂子，状如小石榴，房中子至细，青白色，如粟米粒。）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184154-ho0iop7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184154-ho0iop7","updated":"20240612184154"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子气味苦寒，生于海滨，得太阳寒水之气，故治齿痛。太阳上禀寒气，下有标阳，阳能散阴，故能出虫。太阳阳热之气，能温肌腠。又，太阳主筋所生病，故治肉痹拘急。肉痹，肌痹也。拘急，筋不柔和也。久服轻身，使人健行，走及奔马者，太阳本寒标热，少阴本热标寒，太阳合少阴而助 脉也。盖阳 者，足太阳之别，起于跟中，出于外踝。阴 者，足循于内踝。莨菪子禀太阳少阴标本之精，而助 脉，故轻身健走若是也。禀阴精之气，故强志益力。禀阳热之化，故通神见鬼。下品之药，不宜久服，故又曰∶多食令人狂走，戒之也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184245-bvh4kzq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184245-bvh4kzq"}},{"ID":"20240612184247-tnadgta","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184247-tnadgta","updated":"20240612184304"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184247-gwdn6ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184247-gwdn6ji","updated":"20240612184247"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"莨菪子，又名天仙子。有毒。主风痫癫狂，湿痹拘急，助足健行，理齿蛀蚀，久服轻身，走及飞马，炒熟有益，生则泻人，《别说》云：煮一二日尚入土萌芽，用者宜审也。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184154-a5r622j","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184154-a5r622j"}},{"ID":"20240612184228-1tnpvqx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-1tnpvqx","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：天仙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9up36uc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9up36uc","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-1dfea12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-1dfea12","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tiān Xiān Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-aurzfm4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-aurzfm4","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-dmkoq5q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-dmkoq5q","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 莨菪子、山烟、牙痛子、熏牙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-pirvj0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-pirvj0a","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-hmeutnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-hmeutnd","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" SEMEN HYOSCYAMI"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ktecc75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ktecc75","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-o2c5jb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-o2c5jb9","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为茄科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"莨菪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Hyoscyamus niger L. 的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"成熟种子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏、秋二季果皮变黄色时，采摘果实，曝晒，打下种子，筛去果皮、枝梗，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-79lhxal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-79lhxal","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-puzw1r8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-puzw1r8","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈类扁肾形或扁卵形，直径约1mm。表面棕黄色或灰黄色，有细密的网纹，略尖的一端有点状种脐。剖面灰白色，油质，有胚乳，胚弯曲。无臭，味微辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9rvsdju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9rvsdju","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-v2a0riw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-v2a0riw","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-mkr4sz0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-mkr4sz0","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-v88ixnc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-v88ixnc","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）取本品粉末0.5g，置试管中，加浓氨试液0.5ml，混匀，再加氯仿5ml,密塞，时时振摇半小时，滤过，滤液蒸干，残渣加0.5ml氯仿使溶解，取溶液5滴，置水浴上蒸干，加发烟硝酸4滴，蒸干，残渣加无水乙醇1ml与氢氧化钾1小粒,显紫。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-w5de5bg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-w5de5bg","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末1g，加石油醚（30～60℃）10ml，超声处理15分钟，弃去石油醚液，同上再处理一次，药渣挥干溶剂，加浓氨试液与乙醇的等量混合溶液2ml湿润，加氯仿20ml，超声处理15分钟，滤过，滤液蒸干，残渣加无水乙醇0.5ml使溶解，作为供试品溶液。另取硫酸阿托品、氢溴酸东莨菪碱对照品，加无水乙醇制成每1ml各含1mg的混合溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各5μl，分别点于同一硅胶Ｇ薄层板上，以醋酸乙酯-甲醇-浓氨试液（17:2:1）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，依次喷以碘化铋钾试液与亚硝酸钠乙醇试液。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同的两个棕色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-b8670pq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-b8670pq","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9x68lsx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9x68lsx","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归心、胃、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-8hgr77r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-8hgr77r","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-982o7qj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-982o7qj","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦、辛，温；有大毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-f4lvdox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-f4lvdox","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-bf7dt0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-bf7dt0b","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 心脏病、心动过速、青光眼患者及孕妇忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-xg4xt5s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-xg4xt5s","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-8vu962n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-8vu962n","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解痉止痛，安神定喘。用于胃痉挛疼痛，喘咳，癫狂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-emhfvx9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-emhfvx9","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ntl8lmu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ntl8lmu","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 0.06～0.6g。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-nle11if","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-nle11if","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-xofak8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-xofak8s","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-rjbs2h2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-rjbs2h2","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：天仙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-w4v8no4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-w4v8no4","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-jt0txmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-jt0txmo","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tiān Xiān Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-pipe6ea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-pipe6ea","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-a789h0j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-a789h0j","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 莨菪子（《本经》），莨蓎子（《本草经集注》），牙痛子（《本草原始》），小颠茄子（《岭南采药录》），熏牙子（《陕西中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-dc7fb45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-dc7fb45","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-3bztsxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-3bztsxd","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-qmlhpse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-qmlhpse","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-73ch04d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-73ch04d","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为茄科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"莨菪"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"种子"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。8～9月，果实成熟时割取全株或果枝，晒干后，打下种子，除去杂质。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-k0gn82g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-k0gn82g","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-wuzm9r3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-wuzm9r3","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生于宅边的荒地上，或为栽培。分布黑龙江、吉林、辽宁、河北、河南、浙江、江西、山东、江苏、山西、陕西、甘肃、内蒙古、青海、新疆、宁夏、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-5jk5183","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-5jk5183","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-gyjf5re","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-gyjf5re","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 莨菪，又名：横唐（《本经》），行唐（《别录》），葾（《玉篇》），山烟、山大烟、野大烟。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-fh7xnrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-fh7xnrj","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一年生或二年生草本，有特殊臭味。根肉质、粗大，多分枝。茎高40～80厘米，上部具分枝，全体被白色腺毛。基生叶大，叶柄扁宽而短，叶片长卵形，长14～20厘米，呈不整齐的羽状浅裂，裂片三角形或窄三角形，先端急尖，两面被白色直立长柔毛及腺毛，以下面较多；茎生叶互生，排列较密，无柄，卵状披针形，每侧有2～5个疏大齿牙或浅裂，叶渐上渐小，最上部的叶常呈交叉互生，成2列状。花腋生，单一，径2～3厘米；萼杯状，绿色，5齿状浅裂，外被直立白柔毛；花冠漏斗状，5浅裂，常有一裂隙较深，裂片先端圆钝，浅黄色，具紫色网状脉纹，外被短柔毛；雄蕊5，着生于花冠管上，不等长，略与花冠管等长，花药深蓝紫色；子房略呈椭圆形，花柱单一，柱头头状。萼管基部膨大，宿存，内包壶形蒴果，2室，盖裂。种子多数，呈不规则阔肾形，胚弯生。花期5月。果期6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ybfm4n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ybfm4n5","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的根（莨菪根）亦供药用，另详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-7bl4570","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-7bl4570","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-1w6nvuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-1w6nvuu","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的种子，略呈肾形或宽卵圆形，两面扁平，直径约1毫米，表面棕黄色或灰棕色，有细密的网纹，脐点处凸出。气无，味微辛。以粒大、饱满、无杂质者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-j5ajov7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-j5ajov7","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主产河南、河北、辽宁。此外，吉林、黑龙江、江西、青海、陕西、浙江、西藏等地亦产。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ipciyoo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ipciyoo","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"过去尚有一种进口天仙子，商品习称\"南天仙子\"，为爵床科植物水蓑衣（参见\"大青草\"条）的种子。外形略呈心脏形而扁平，表面红褐色或棕红色，较平坦，无网纹或突起，但边缘有一圈灰黄色透明物，遇水则成粘液状。气微，味淡。曾习用于广东、广西、福建等地。此种进口天仙子，与上述天仙子截然不同，不能同等使用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-krb0q0z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-krb0q0z","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-viyaisd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-viyaisd","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 含莨菪碱（hyoscyamine）、阿托品（atropine）、东莨菪碱（scopolamine）、l-东莨菪碱（atroscine）、脂肪油等。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ybw4oqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ybw4oqx","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ohg2cgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ohg2cgp","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《雷公炮炙论》：\"修事十两，以头醋一镒，煮尽醋为度，却用黄牛乳汁浸一宿，至明，看乳汁黑，即是莨菪子，晒干别捣重筛用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-g9m9e27","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-g9m9e27","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9bdoxwq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9bdoxwq","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《四川中药志》：\"入心、胃，肝三经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-7czd7vw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-7czd7vw","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-olotops","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-olotops","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 苦辛，温，有毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-z9fgunf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-z9fgunf","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味苦，寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-v9s79oc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-v9s79oc","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮炙论》：\"大毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-88kkd18","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-88kkd18","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《别录》：\"甘，有毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-h3ex6mn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-h3ex6mn","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《药性论》：\"味苦辛。微热，有大毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-mquxmp2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-mquxmp2","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-13bpt3g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-13bpt3g","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 有大毒，内服宜慎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-0kf4k67","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-0kf4k67","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"多食令人狂走。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-q84bnj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-q84bnj3","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《雷公炮炙论》：\"勿误服，冲人心，大烦闷，眼生星火。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ugl5rjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ugl5rjm","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-e1dg1vv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-e1dg1vv","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 定痫，止痛。治癫狂，风痫，风痹厥痛，神经痛，喘咳，胃痛，久痢，久泻，脱肛，牙痛，痈肿，恶疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-puuhv1u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-puuhv1u","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主齿痛出虫，肉痹拘急。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-j616wu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-j616wu6","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗癫狂风痫，颠倒拘挛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-gaful9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-gaful9y","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"生能泻人，热炒止冷痢，炒焦研细末，治下部脱肛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-iwckw2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-iwckw2j","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《本草拾遗》：\"主痃癖，除邪逐风。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-tn39l1a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-tn39l1a","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《日华子本草》：\"烧熏虫牙，洗阴汗。\""}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-4j0t42m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-4j0t42m","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-6ebwpd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-6ebwpd4","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：入丸、散，2～4分。外用：煎水洗，研末调敷或烧烟熏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-mwh4g9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-mwh4g9y","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-cxm9n1k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-cxm9n1k","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治五癫，反侧羊呜，目翻吐沫，不知痛处：猪卵一具（阴干百日），莨菪子三升，牛黄八分（研），鲤鱼胆五分，桂心十分（研）。上五味，切，以清酒一升，渍莨菪子，暴令干，尽酒止，乃捣令下筛。酒服五分匕，日再，当如醉，不知稍增，以知为度。忌生葱等。（《古今录验方》莨菪子散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ja8gjhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ja8gjhx","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治风痹厥痛：天仙子三钱（炒），大草乌头、甘草半两，五灵脂一两，为末，糊丸，梧子大，以螺青为衣。每服十丸，男子菖蒲酒下，女子芫花汤下。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-91unief","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-91unief","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治积冷痃癖，不思饮食，四肢羸困：莨菪子三分（水淘去浮者），大枣四十九枚。上药，以水三升相和，煮水尽，即取枣去皮核。每于食前吃一枚，粥饮下亦得，觉热即止。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ug1nv6q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ug1nv6q","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治年久呷嗽：莨菪子、木香、熏黄等分。为末，以羊脂涂青纸上，撒末于上，卷作筒，烧烟熏吸之。（《崔氏纂要方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-79bwx1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-79bwx1d","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治水泻日久：青州干枣十个，去核，入莨菪子填满，扎定，烧存性。每粟米饮服一钱。（《圣惠方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-abm37us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-abm37us","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治赤白痢，脐腹疼痛，肠滑后重：大黄半两，莨菪子一两。上捣罗为散，每服一钱，米饮调下，食前。（《普济方》妙功散）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-67wd0fl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-67wd0fl","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治石痈坚如石，不作脓者：醋和莨菪子末，敷头上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-hw37xi1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-hw37xi1","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治恶疮似癞者：烧莨菪子末敷之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ueqhiju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ueqhiju","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治被打伤破，腹中有瘀血：末茛菪子敷疮上。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-0lozezu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-0lozezu","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩治猘犬毒：服莨菪子七枚，日一。（⑦方以下出《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-dfi49ao","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-dfi49ao","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-tcadq7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-tcadq7k","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-emz9a1b","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-emz9a1b","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：天仙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-p4jy3ri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-p4jy3ri","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-pxkr5ry","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-pxkr5ry","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Tiān Xiān Zǐ"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-t495qx1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-t495qx1","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9mwtkga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9mwtkga","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 莨菪子、莨菪实、牙痛子、小颠茄子、米罐子、熏牙子"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-xf7l9lz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-xf7l9lz","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-zpu0dbz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-zpu0dbz","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Black Henbane"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-oxokoi9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-oxokoi9","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-sl86r0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-sl86r0r","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《本经图经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-jsyuq28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-jsyuq28","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《纲目》：莨菪、云实、防葵、赤商陆，皆能令人狂惑，昔人有未发其义者，盖此者皆有毒，能使痰迷心窍，蔽其神明，以乱其视听故耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-x428plb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-x428plb","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《日华子本草》：莨菪子有毒，甘草、升麻、犀角并能解之。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-0fo14w8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-0fo14w8","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-nplv4l5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-nplv4l5","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为茄科植物莨菪、小天仙子的成熟种子。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-88emnrb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-88emnrb","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Hyoscyamus niger L.2.Hyoscyamus bohemicus F. W. Schmit."}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-1tsdggq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-1tsdggq","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：秋播者于6月上旬，春播者7月中旬，嵫方在8-9月，当下部果皮呈共同色，上部种子充实呈淡黄色时，于分枝处割下，放通风处，1星期后脱粒晒干即成。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-xvxta86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-xvxta86","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-og8p66y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-og8p66y","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于村边、山野、路旁、宅旁等处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ekx7d1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ekx7d1l","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于村边、田野、路旁等处。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-qz3wyvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-qz3wyvi","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于东北、华北、西北及山东、安徽、河南、四川、西藏等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-mtmzjz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-mtmzjz2","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布于东北、河北。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-p4yjet4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-p4yjet4","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-94sruvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-94sruvs","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 一年生工二年生草本，高达1m。全株被粘改建的腺毛。根粗壮，肉质。一年生植株茎极短，茎基部具莲座状叶丛，叶长可达30cm，宽达10cm。二年生植析茎伸长分枝。茎生叶互生，无柄，基部半抱茎；叶片卵形至三角状卵形，长4-10cm，宽2-6cm，先端钝或渐尖，边缘呈羽状浅裂或深裂；向顶端的叶呈浅波状，两面除生粘性腺毛外，沿叶脉并被柔毛。花腋生，单一，径2-3cm；花萼筒状钟形，5浅裂，花后增大成坛状，有10条纵助，外被直立白柔毛；花冠钟状，5浅裂，黄色囊有紫堇色网纹；雄蕊5，着生于花冠筒的近中部，稍长于花冠；花药纵绽裂形，深蓝紫色；子房2室，柱头头状，2浅裂。蒴果藏于宿存的萼内，长卵圆形，成熟时盖裂。种子小，近圆盘形，淡黄棕色，有多数网状凹穴。花期5月，果期6月。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-uhgyz4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-uhgyz4p","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"形态与上种十分接近，主要区别：本种为一年生草本，植株较小。根细瘦而带木质。无莲座叶从，茎生叶不作羽状分裂或仅有极浅的波大辩论浅裂。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-qr2g34g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-qr2g34g","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-z7z4mho","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-z7z4mho","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生物学特性 性喜温暖湿润气候，生长适宜的温度为20-30℃，不耐严寒，喜阳光，以土层深厚、疏松肥活、排水良好的中性及微碱性砂质壤土栽培为宜。忌连作，不宜以西红柿等茄科植物为前作。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-7tn42yh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-7tn42yh","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术 用种子繁殖。直播法：北方播种时间为3月至4月中旬，长江流域可秋播或春播，以秋播为主。条播或穴播。条播：行距30-40cm，开浅沟，将种子均匀撒入，覆土，以盖没种子为度。穴播：穴距30cm×30cm或40cm×40cm，每穴播种10颗左右，播后可稍镇压，应经常浅水，温度在18-23℃有足够的土壤温度，播后10d左右出苗，苗齐后进行间苗1次，每穴留壮苗1株。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ahirvmx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ahirvmx","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理 秋播者中耕除草3次。第1次在当年11-12月，第2次于翌年2-3月，第3次在4月。春播者在4月上中旬、5月下旬、6月上旬各中耕1次。中耕宜浅，每穴中耕后追肥1次，以氮肥为主，先淡后浓，先少后多。4月上旬及5月上旬花果期再用2%的磷酸钙溶液根外追肥两次，可提高种子产量。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-4vxm7vb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-4vxm7vb","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治 虫害有红蜘蛛，春季发生，可用化学药剂防治，并注意不宜选豆类、棉花、茄等为前作。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-3hfp5kr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-3hfp5kr","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-fi421c4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-fi421c4","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 （1）莨菪子 种子细小，肾形或卵圆形，稍扁，直径1mm。表面棕黄色或灰黄色，具细密隆起的网纹，种脐处突起。气微，味微辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-beaa4sk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-beaa4sk","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）小莨菪子 种子与莨菪子不易区别。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9o4arad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9o4arad","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以颗粒饱满、均匀者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-gvav2a1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-gvav2a1","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 莨菪种子纵切面：种皮外表皮细胞呈不规则波状凸起，波峰顶端渐尖或钝圆，长至125μm，细胞壁具透明的纹理；种皮内表皮细胞1列，壁薄，内含棕色物。胚乳细胞含脂肪油及糊粉粒；胚弯曲，子叶细胞含脂肪油，胚根明显。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-2b9h1fi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-2b9h1fi","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-gcrd7lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-gcrd7lk","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阿托品作用范围很广，利用其一种作用于治疗时，其他作用即成为不需要的副作用，5-10mg即能产生显着的中毒症状，最低致死量则为0.08-0.13g，相差十几倍。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-sk7rutw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-sk7rutw","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"东莨菪硷对成人的最小致死量约为100mg，幼儿约为10mg。阿托品5-10mg即可产生中毒症状，最低致死量则为0.08-0.13g。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-6l72ywm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-6l72ywm","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-onx2eox","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-onx2eox","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.莨菪 种子含天仙子胺（hyoscyamine)0.02%-0.17%，东莨菪碱（scopolamine)0.01%-0.08%[1]及阿托品（atropine)[2]等；还含脂肪，其量可达25%。脂肪酸组成为：肉豆蔻酸（myristic aicd)0.3%，棕榈酸（palmitic acid)6.5%，硬脂酸（stearic acid）1.6%，油酸（oleic acid)35.2%，亚油酸（linoleic acid)56.4%[3]。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-w00otya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-w00otya","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.小天仙子 种子含天仙子胺0.04%，东莨菪碱0.01%[1]。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-kfe1w4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-kfe1w4w","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-uxzfx38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-uxzfx38","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.对循环系统的作用：1.1.对心脏的作用：东莨菪碱能解除迷走神经对心脏的抑制，使交感神经作用占优势，故可使心率加快。阿托品有类似作用，而且更强。给兔和犬静脉注射阿托品2-3mg/kg或东莨菪碱4mg/kg，可拮抗肾上腺素或去甲肾上腺素所诱发的心律紊乱，但不能拮抗引起的心律加快。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-0tspfem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-0tspfem","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.2.对血管及血流动力学的作用：离体兔血管灌流表明，东莨菪碱可以拮抗肾上腺素引起的收缩作用，但比阿托品弱，同时还能对抗乙酰胆碱所致的血压下降，改善微循环。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-3q5mu3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-3q5mu3o","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对中枢神经的作用：2.1.对行为的影响：东莨菪碱注射于兔侧脑室，可出现闭眼，侧卧、翻正反射消失，活动减少等现象，与冬眠合剂或与戊巴比妥类合用均可使动物活动减少，表现出与中枢抑制药的协同作用。但有报告，小剂量东莨菪碱能使小鼠自主活动增加，并能对抗利血平等引起的活动减小，表现中枢兴奋作用。因而认为，东莨菪碱对中枢神系系统的作用是双向性的。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-7parukr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-7parukr","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.2.对动物脑电的影响：给清醒猫腹腔注射氢溴酸东莨菪碱0.05-0.1mg/kg，脑电图由低幅快波转变为不规则的高幅慢波，动物表现安静。当剂量增至0.25-5mg/kg时，脑电图出现高度同步化和不规则高幅慢波，此时动物表现兴奋狂躁。东莨菪碱对犬、兔和大鼠等动物所引起的脑电反应亦非常近似，并能阻断多种生理刺激所引起的惊醒反应。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-js1f4jh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-js1f4jh","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.3.对条件反射的影响：东莨菪碱能不同程度地阻断大鼠回避性条件反射和二级条件反射，阻断率与剂量呈平行关系，阿托品作用较弱。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-b0pyk31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-b0pyk31","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.4.对痛觉的影响：家兔钾离子透入法测痛试验表明，腹腔注射东莨菪碱4mg/kg，给药后30分钟痛阈提高49%。静脉注射同样剂量的东莨菪碱，给药后20分钟痛阈提高37%。而侧脑注射5mg/只后20分钟痛阈提高53%，与度冷丁（60mg/kg腹腔注射）合用痛阈提高147%，而单用度冷丁痛阈升高93%，提示两药合用有协同作用。小鼠热板法试验表明，腹腔注射东莨菪碱1.25mg/kg，给药后15分钟痛阈提高62%，与小剂量度冷丁（10mg/kg腹腔注射）合用，给药后15分钟痛阈提高126%，而单用小剂量度冷丁痛阈仅提高23%，这些与家兔实验结果相一致。另外，给家兔侧脑室注射去甲肾上腺素20mg/只后，10分钟时痛阈下降46%，并能减弱度冷丁的镇痛作用。东莨菪碱和去甲肾上腺素合用，则能对抗后者的抗镇痛作用。因此推测东莨菪碱的镇痛和加强度冷丁镇痛的作用，可能与其抗去甲肾上腺素的作用有关。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-0rpk88l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-0rpk88l","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对腺体及平滑肌的作用：阿托品对腺体分泌有抑制作用，对活动过强或痉挛状态下的平滑肌有明显的弛缓作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9b274on","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9b274on","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.其它作用：：阿托品具有散瞳,升高眼压及调节麻痹的作用,保护胃粘膜作用,钙拮抗作用,对肾功能衰竭保护作用,另对脊髓损伤也有治疗作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-mh2pks5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-mh2pks5","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-euieenj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-euieenj","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《雷公炮炙论》：修事十两，以头醋一镒，煮尽醋为度，却用黄牛乳汁浸一宿，至明，看乳汁黑，即是莨菪子，晒干别捣重筛用。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ofxz7kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ofxz7kp","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9k0rsft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9k0rsft","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）取本品粉末0.5g，置试管中，加乙醚5ml与10%，氨溶液数滴，密寒，振摇，2h后，吸取醚液少量于栽玻片上，挥干醚液，滴加碘化铋钾试液2滴，数分钟后，置显微镜下观察，可见黄紫色，似飞鸟状结晶。（检查莨菪类生物碱）（2）取本品粉末0.5g，置试管中，加浓氨试液0.5ml，混匀，再加氯仿5ml，密寒，振摇0.5h，滤过。滤液蒸干，残渣加氯仿溶解，吸取溶液5滴，置水浴上蒸干，加发烟硝酸4滴，蒸干，残渣加无水乙醇1ml与氢氧化钾1小粒，显紫色。（检查莨菪类生物碱）（3）薄层色谱 取本品粉末1g，加石油醚（30-60℃）10ml，超声处理15min，弃去石油醚液，同上再处理1次，药渣挥干溶剂，加浓氨试液与乙醇的等量混合溶液2ml湿润，加氯仿20ml，超声处理15min，滤过。滤液蒸干，残渣加无水乙醇0.5ml溶解，作供试品溶液。另取硫酸阿托品、氢溴酸东莨菪碱加无水乙醇制成每1ml各含1mg的混合溶液，作对照品溶液，吸取上述2种溶液5μm，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以醋酸乙酯-甲醇-浓氨试液（17：2：1）展开，取出，晾干，依次喷碘化铋钾与亚硝酸钠乙醇试液。样品色谱在与对照品色谱相应位置上显相同的两个桔红色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-uhx82xb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-uhx82xb","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-e8x5ufs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-e8x5ufs","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归心；肝；胃经"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-1qkg75o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-1qkg75o","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ek5at0q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ek5at0q","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味苦；辛；性温；大毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-skbncq0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-skbncq0","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-wmo9jwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-wmo9jwh","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 有大毒，内服宜慎。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-kqmt1eg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-kqmt1eg","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本经》：多食令人狂走。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-0u1qs1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-0u1qs1x","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《雷公炮炙论》：勿误服，冲人心，大烦闷，眼生星火。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-t8o3n79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-t8o3n79","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ul9trwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ul9trwi","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 解泾昌涌；安心定痫。主脘腹疼痛；风湿痹痛；风虫牙痛；跌打伤痛；喘嗽不止；泻痢脱肛；癫狂；惊痫；痈肿疮毒"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-76m9pu7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-76m9pu7","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ki90jym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ki90jym","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，0.6-1.2g；散剂，0.06-0.6g。外用：适量，研末调敷衍；煎水洗；或烧烟熏。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-hvhdbyn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-hvhdbyn","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-ltfh77p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-ltfh77p","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主齿痛出虫，肉痹拘急。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-7h5nsbc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-7h5nsbc","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：疗癫狂风癎，颠倒拘挛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-4p1wqt3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-4p1wqt3","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：生能泻人，热炒止冷痢，炒焦研细末，治下部脱肛。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-murmxi5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-murmxi5","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草拾遗》：主痃癖，除邪逐风。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-gzlqs16","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-gzlqs16","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《日华子本草》：烧熏虫牙，洗阴汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-syrj1ur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-syrj1ur","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240612184228-9v232kr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184228-9v232kr","updated":"20240612184228"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240612184230-ejq9zq9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240612184230-ejq9zq9"}},{"ID":"20240612184231-nw5xyfk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240612184231-nw5xyfk"}}]}